    <li><Aff id="travelingmailbox" href="https://travelingmailbox.com/" text="Traveling Mailbox" /></li>
    <li><Aff id="virtualpostmail" href="https://refer.virtualpostmail.com/l/13ELDJ264/" text="Virtual Post Mail" /></li>
    <li><Aff id="stable" href="https://www.usestable.com/" text="Stable" /></li>
  </ul>
  <p>More: <a href="/switch-virtual-mailbox-location/">switching mailbox locations</a> · <a href="/virtual-mailbox-pricing-comparison/">all providers compared</a> · <a href="/">Mailbox Atlas home</a></p>
</Base>
